\" d=\"M9.5 17.5 4.8 12.8l1.4-1.4 3.3 3.3 8.3-8.3 1.4 1.4z\"/></svg></span><span>Tư vấn kỹ thuật</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"sa-about__point-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M9.5 17.5 4.8 12.8l1.4-1.4 3.3 3.3 8.3-8.3 1.4 1.4z\"/></svg></span><span>Hỗ trợ tận tâm</span></li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"sa-actions sa-about__actions\">\n<a class=\"sa-btn sa-btn--solid\" href=\"/gioi-thieu/\">Tìm hiểu thêm</a>\n</div>\n\n[/col]\n\n[/row]\n\n[/section]\n\n[section label=\"Why Choose Us\" class=\"sa-section sa-section--alt sa-why\" padding=\"0px\" padding__sm=\"0px\"]\n\n[row width=\"custom\" custom_width=\"1240px\"]\n\n[col span=\"12\" span__sm=\"12\"]\n\n<div class=\"sa-section-head is-center\">\n<p class=\"sa-eyebrow\">Lợi thế</p>\n<h2 class=\"sa-title\">VÌ SAO LỰA CHỌN THỊNH PHÁT?</h2>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sa-why__grid\">\n<article class=\"sa-why-card\">\n  <div class=\"sa-why-card__top\">\n    <span class=\"sa-why-card__num\">01</span>\n    <span class=\"sa-why-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M24 6 8 14v12c0 10 7.2 18.8 16 21 8.8-2.2 16-11 16-21V14L24 6zm0 6.2 10 5v8.6c0 6.6-4.2 12.6-10 14.6-5.8-2-10-8-10-14.6v-8.6l10-5z\"/><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"m21.2 28.8-4-4 2.1-2.1 1.9 1.9 5.6-5.6 2.1 2.1z\"/></svg>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n  <h3 class=\"sa-why-card__title\">GIẢI PHÁP PHÙ HỢP</h3>\n  <p class=\"sa-why-card__text\">Tư vấn thiết bị theo nhu cầu và đặc điểm hệ thống.</p>\n</article>\n<article class=\"sa-why-card\">\n  <div class=\"sa-why-card__top\">\n    <span class=\"sa-why-card__num\">02</span>\n    <span class=\"sa-why-card__icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n      <svg viewBox=\"0 0 48 48\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M10 38V14h6v24h-6zm11 0V8h6v30h-6zm11 0V20h6v18h-6z\"/></svg>\n    </span>\n  </div>\n  <h3 class=\"sa-why-card__title\">HỖ TRỢ KỸ THUẬT</h3>